### 1) User exists -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 101,
  "productName": "Laptop",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 2) User not found -> 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 999,
  "productName": "Laptop",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 3) Stop user-service first -> 503 Service Unavailable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 102,
  "productName": "Phone",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 4) Invalid data -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 101,
  "quantity": 0
}

### List all saved orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Get one order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/5001
